          "path": [ "api", "v1", "pipeline", "trigger-by-cap" ]
        },
        "description": "Tests Layer 6: Replay of an already-processed (identifier, sender) pair is caught by PostgreSQL durable PK and rejected with 409 Conflict."
      }
    },
    {
